  "$comment": "Every file the kit writes. mode: managed (kit owns it; safe 3-way update), seed (written once, then yours), json-merge (kit keys merged into your JSON), lines (kit lines appended if missing). root: project (default) or git. phase: the adoption phase that introduces the file.",
